  "speech": [],
  "notes": "Person boxes drafted by Claude from one frame per second plus frames at 6.506, 7.508, 8.3 and 8.592 s for the exits. Portrait video; the camera pans to follow them, then onto the wall. Boxes cover the body; the tote bags are left out where they hang outside it. Reviewed by eduardo on 2026-11-15 against an overlay of every keyframe. Faces not labelled. r3 leaves after 6.006 s, r2 after 7.007 s, r1 after 8.008 s (only an arm at the right edge then); nobody is in frame from 8.3 s. r1: tan short-sleeved shirt, jeans, white tote bag. r2: red plaid shirt over a white tank top, light ripped jeans. r3: white striped shirt, sage-green trousers, cream tote bag."
